## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **1. Signature Color — what feels like YOU?**
> Your projects page already uses `emerald/green` accents. Options:
> - **Emerald** `#34d399` — techy, fresh, growth (matches your existing projects page)
> - **Teal/Cyan** `#22d3ee` — modern, sharp, digital
> - **Amber** `#f59e0b` — warm, confident, distinctive
> - **Your pick** — any color that resonates with you personally?
> 
> I'll go with **emerald** by default since it's already in your DNA, but tell me if another color speaks to you.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **2. Home page section order — which feels right?**
> - **Option A:** Hero → Featured Projects → Experience → Credentials → Latest Whisper
> - **Option B:** Hero → Experience → Featured Projects → Credentials → Latest Whisper
> - **Option C:** Hero → Featured Projects → Experience → Credentials (no whisper on home)
>
> I'll go with **Option A** by default (lead with work, not titles).

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **3. Photo placeholder style:**
> - **Option A:** Geometric/abstract avatar (colored shape with your initials)
> - **Option B:** Empty frame with "Photo coming soon" text
> - **Option C:** No photo placeholder at all, add it later
>
> I'll go with **Option A** by default.

