## Proposed Changes

### Overview of All Changes

```
Phase 1: Foundation & Identity     (globals.css, layout.tsx, Shell.tsx)
Phase 2: Home Page Restructure     (app/page.tsx, new FeaturedProject component)
Phase 3: SEO & Public Assets       (public/*, metadata, JSON-LD)
Phase 4: Page Polish               (projects, whispers, contact, education, 404)
```

---

### Phase 1 — Foundation & Identity

#### [MODIFY] [globals.css](file:///f:/WebDev/personal-website/app/globals.css)
Currently just `@import "tailwindcss"`. Will add:
- **Signature color CSS custom properties** (emerald accent threaded site-wide)
- **Custom scrollbar** styling (thin, matches theme)
- **Smooth scroll** behavior
- **Custom selection colors** using the signature color
- **Subtle body texture** (optional grain/noise overlay via CSS)
- **Custom font-size scale** via CSS variables
- **Focus-visible** refinements
- **Reduced-motion** media query support

#### [MODIFY] [layout.tsx](file:///f:/WebDev/personal-website/app/layout.tsx)
- Add **OG/Twitter meta tags** with `jabirah.pages.dev` as canonical
- Add **JSON-LD Person schema** 
- Update metadata description
- Add `metadataBase` URL

#### [MODIFY] [Shell.tsx](file:///f:/WebDev/personal-website/components/Shell.tsx)
- Fix the `any` type → proper `AnimationProps` interface
- Add `prefers-reduced-motion` support (disable/reduce animations)
- Thread signature accent color through selection styles per-page
- Refactor hardcoded theme values into a `PAGE_THEMES` constant

#### [NEW] [lib/theme.ts](file:///f:/WebDev/personal-website/lib/theme.ts)
- Centralized page theme configuration
- Signature color constants
- Animation presets extracted from Shell.tsx

