## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```bash
npm run lint          # ESLint passes
npm run build         # Static export succeeds without errors
```

### Browser Verification
- Launch dev server and visually verify each page
- Check all 5 routes render correctly
- Verify signature color appears consistently across pages
- Confirm placeholder components display properly
- Test mobile responsiveness (nav, hero, featured projects)
- Test keyboard navigation still works
- Verify OG meta tags render in page source

### SEO Verification
- Confirm `robots.txt` accessible at `/robots.txt`
- Confirm `sitemap.xml` accessible at `/sitemap.xml`
- Confirm favicon displays in browser tab
- Check page source for JSON-LD structured data
